Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:15:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/28] test-posix: Check growth, offsets, the file size limit
 and errors in ftruncate and truncate

The old test used a fixed file name and was skipped on Linux; it now
works in a temporary directory and runs there.
